    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} magically animates one or two boulders it can see within 60 feet of itself. Each boulder uses the Galeb Duhr stat block, except it has Intelligence and Charisma scores of 1 and lacks this action. The boulder takes its turn immediately after the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} on the same Initiative count, and it obeys the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}. A boulder remains animate for 1 minute or until it or the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} dies.</p>",
